  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Rehabilitacin y Mantenimiento de Infraestructura Vial en la Repblica Dominicana</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Road Infrastructure Maintenance and Rehabilitation Program in the Dominican Republic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo del programa es contribuir a mejorar la conectividad regional del pas, a travs de la provisin de servicios de transporte seguros, confiables y accesibles, garantizando su disponibilidad para el acceso a servicios bsicos y mercados; y promoviendo un modelo de empleabilidad inclusiva asociado a las obras.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development general objective of the program is to contribute to improving the regional connectivity of the country, through the provision of safe, reliable and accessible transport services, guaranteeing their availability for access to basic services and markets; and promoting an inclusive employability model associated with public works.</narrative>
  </description>
